---
interface Props {
  checklistHref: string;
  guideHref: string;
  guideName: string;
}
const { checklistHref, guideHref, guideName } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="do-next">
  <h2>Do this next</h2>
  <p>Take your estimate and run it past the one-page <a href={checklistHref}>charter quote checklist</a> — it lists everything to confirm with a broker before you pay anything.</p>
  <p>For the full cost breakdown behind these numbers, read the <a href={guideHref}>{guideName}</a> for the full methodology.</p>
</div>
